  "notes": {
    "criticalParentingWarning": "Socket_ChassisMount_b is NOT chassis-mounted despite its name: it is the upright/knuckle that ties both wishbone arms to the wheel, and must ride the KNUCKLE body, not the chassis. Socket_WheelCenter also rides the knuckle. Do not classify parts by name substring alone - see roleCategory/role below.",
    "damperLowerParent": "Socket_SingleDamperLower is a child of Chassis_Bottom (the lower wishbone arm) in the source glTF, not of the knuckle. Its live position must be derived from the lower arm's placement, not the upright's.",
    "steeringRodParent": "Socket_SteeringRod is a child of Socket_WheelCenter (rides the knuckle at the outboard end). The inboard end is NOT part of this model - it must be driven by the vehicle's real steering rack body/joint (no new physics should be invented for it)."
  },
